{"ID":"20240205170450-q6oed1n","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205170450-q6oed1n","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170450-q6oed1n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170547-aw30gke\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611112732-mpf4vjd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"144石硫磺","type":"doc","updated":"20240813105730"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240813105157-wipqvc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813105157-wipqvc8","updated":"20240813105157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 592px;","style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石硫磺-20240813105157-ziy0hxk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\" parent-style=\"width: 592px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205170547-aw30gke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170547-aw30gke","updated":"20240813105201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 592px;","style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/硫磺-20240205170547-eqq5qn5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\" parent-style=\"width: 592px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813105304-6bvnls4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813105304-6bvnls4","updated":"20240813105304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 592px;","style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石硫磺 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石硫磺 1-20240813105304-ka4a2j3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\" parent-style=\"width: 592px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813105409-oc2q88g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813105409-oc2q88g","updated":"20240813105730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石硫磺 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石硫磺 2-20240813105409-ye16ju6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石硫磺 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石硫磺 5-20240813105730-bswkd7x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813105523-defp8te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813105523-defp8te","updated":"20240813105634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 769px;","style":"width: 759px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石硫磺 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石硫磺 3-20240813105523-vnj70h7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 759px;\" parent-style=\"width: 769px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 515px;","style":"width: 505px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石硫磺 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石硫磺 4-20240813105634-9bgwun2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 505px;\" parent-style=\"width: 515px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240621172933-2cecllq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621172933-2cecllq","updated":"20240813105448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：石硫磺的颜色呈鲜黄色，像鸡蛋黄；"}]},{"ID":"20240611112648-5lrkjh8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112648-5lrkjh8"}},{"ID":"20240611113421-n2o7x8p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113421-n2o7x8p","updated":"20240611113428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113421-4bce37g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113421-4bce37g","updated":"20240611113421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸温。主妇人蚀阴。疽痔恶血。坚筋骨。除头秃。能化金银铜铁奇物。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113421-bzahnv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113421-bzahnv8","updated":"20240611113421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尊比阳侯。矾精翕敛。焦土凝坚。温泉泻潋。猛着黄芽。光腾紫焰。金液丹成。因时稽检。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113421-y1unc4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113421-y1unc4j","updated":"20240611113421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛洪曰。四黄惟阳侯为尊。吴普曰。是矾水石液烧令有紫焰者。易注。诤翕翕敛也。魏书传。悦般国。南界。有火山。山旁皆焦。溶流数十里乃凝坚。即石硫黄也。博物志。凡水有石硫黄。其泉则温。赵冬曦赋。凿连岩而泻潋。李时珍曰。其猛毒为七十二石之将。外家谓之阳侯。亦曰黄芽。泊宅编。金液丹。乃流黄炼成。纯阳之物。痼冷者所宜。今夏至人多服之。反为大患。元史传。曹鉴稽检有方。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113343-wrlzuht","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113343-wrlzuht"}},{"ID":"20240611113412-r8yqd65","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113412-r8yqd65","updated":"20240611113417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113412-qwmqctb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113412-qwmqctb","updated":"20240611113412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，温、大热，有毒。主治妇人阴蚀，疽，痔，恶血，坚筋骨，除头秃。治心腹积聚，邪气冷癖在胁，咳逆上气，脚冷疼弱无力，及鼻衄，恶疮，下部 疮，止血，杀疥虫。能化金、银、铜、铁奇物。生东海牧羊山谷中，及太山、河西山，矾石液也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113412-ggrjz92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113412-ggrjz92","updated":"20240611113412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"东海郡属北徐州，而箕山亦有。今第一出扶南林邑，色如鹅子初出壳，名昆仑黄。次出外国，从蜀中来，色深而煌煌。世方用之治脚弱及痼冷甚良。《仙经》颇用之。所化奇物，并是《黄白术》及合丹法。此云矾石液，今南方则无矾石，恐不必尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113343-ciet2qb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113343-ciet2qb"}},{"ID":"20240611113357-jojgk9m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113357-jojgk9m","updated":"20240611113405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113357-hs43g7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113357-hs43g7t","updated":"20240611113357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味酸温，有毒。主治妇人阴蚀，疽痔恶血，坚筋骨，除头秃，能化金银铜铁奇物。（奇，疑作等。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611113357-b808stj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113357-b808stj","updated":"20240611113357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石硫黄出东海牧羊山谷及太行河西山中。今南海诸番岭外州郡皆有，然不及昆仑、雅州舶上来者良。此火石之精所结，所产之处必有温泉，泉水亦作硫黄气。以颗块莹净光腻，色黄，嚼之无声者，弥佳。夹土与石者，不堪入药。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611113357-xahhdbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113357-xahhdbr","updated":"20240611113357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄色黄，其形如石。黄者，土之色。石者土之骨。遇火即焰，其性温热，是禀火土相生之气化。火生于木，故气味酸温，禀火气而温经脉，故主治妇人之阴蚀，及疽痔恶血。禀土石之精，故坚筋骨。阳气长则毛发生，故主头秃。遇火而焰，故能化金银铜铁奇物。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113343-xz145o2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113343-xz145o2"}},{"ID":"20240611113348-v6awifi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113348-v6awifi","updated":"20240611113352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113348-i4j5abj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113348-i4j5abj","updated":"20240611113348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸毒大热，补命门真火不足，而又能疏利大肠，暖精壮阳，杀虫疗疮，救危之药，服之多发背疽。土硫黄辛热腥臭，止入疮药，不堪服食。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113228-c97p293","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113228-c97p293"}},{"ID":"20240611113336-yvpss21","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113336-yvpss21","updated":"20240611113342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113336-mo03tki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113336-mo03tki","updated":"20240611113336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石）石硫黄大补命门相火兼通寒闭不解"}]},{"ID":"20240611113336-5hrnl98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113336-5hrnl98","updated":"20240611113336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄（专入命门。玄寿先生曰。硫是矾之液。矾是铁之精。磁石是铁之母。故铁砂磁石制入硫黄。立成紫粉。）味酸有毒。（权曰。有大毒。以黑锡汤解之。）大热纯阳。号为火精。（时珍曰。凡产石硫黄处。必有温泉作硫黄气。）盖人一身。全赖命门真火周布。始能上贯心肝以主云雨。中及脾胃以蒸水谷。下司开阁以送二便。旁达四肢以应动作。（李时珍曰。命门为藏精系胞之物。其体非脂非肉。白膜裹之。在脊骨第七节两肾中央。系着于脊。下通二肾。上通心肺。贯脑。为生命之源。相火之主。精气之府。人物皆有之。生人生物。皆由此出。即经所谓七节之旁中有小心是也。以相能代心君行事。故曰小心也。）此火既衰。阳微阴盛。内寒先生。外寒后中。厥气逆胸。旁及于胃。胃为肾关。外寒斩关直入。由是无热恶寒。手足厥逆。二便凝结。医以朴硝攻下。猪泽渗利。则二便不通。而凝结益甚。是犹层冰不解。非不消阴。疏阳通胃。则寒莫去而结莫消。书云。命门火衰。服附桂不能补者。须服硫黄补之。按硫黄纯阳。与大黄一寒一热。并号将军。凡阳气暴绝。阴毒伤寒。久患寒泻。脾胃虚寒。命欲垂尽者。须用此主之。又治老人一切风秘冷秘气秘。（热药多秘。唯硫黄暖而能通。寒药多泄。惟黄连肥肠而止泻。）为补虚助阳圣药。且能外杀疮疥一切虫蛊恶毒。并小儿慢惊。妇人阴蚀。皆能有效。但必制造得宜。始可以服。余用法制。（另详杂症求真方内。）凡遇一切虚痨中寒。冷痢冷痛。四肢厥逆。并面赤戴阳。六脉无力。或细数无伦。烦燥欲卧井中。口苦咽干。漱水而不欲咽。审属虚火上浮。阳被阴格者。服无不效。（王好古曰。如太白丹来复丹。皆用硫黄。佐以硝石。至阳佐以至阴。与仲景白通汤佐以人尿猪胆汁大意相同。所以治内伤生冷。外冒暑热霍乱诸病。能去格拒之寒。兼有伏阳。不得不尔。如无伏阳。只是阴虚。更不必以阴药佐之。）今人不晓病机。一见秘结不解。不分寒热。辄用承气以投。讵知寒热不同。冰炭迥异。用之无益。适以致害。可不慎欤！但火极似水。症见寒厥。不细审认。辄作寒治。遽用此药。其害匪浅。（孙升谈圃云。硫黄神仙药也。每岁三伏日饵百粒。去脏腑积滞。有验。但硫黄伏生于石下。阳气溶液凝结而就。其性大热。火炼服之。多发背疽。方勺泊宅编云。金液丹乃硫黄炼成纯阳之物。有痼冷者所宜。今夏至人多服之。反为大患。韩退之作文戒服食。而晚年服硫黄而死。可不戒乎？夏英公有冷病。服钟乳硫黄。莫之纪极。竟以寿终。此其禀受与人异也。）番舶色黄。坚如石者良。土硫黄辛热腥臭。止可入疮药。不可服饵。（硫黄用大肠煮制。其法不佳。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611113245-e42mu0p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113245-e42mu0p"}},{"ID":"20240611113322-3k6xtc1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113322-3k6xtc1","updated":"20240611113330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113322-deddnr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113322-deddnr1","updated":"20240611113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"燥，补阳，杀虫"}]},{"ID":"20240611113322-dva47k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113322-dva47k3","updated":"20240611113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸有毒。大热纯阳（硫黄阳精极热，与大黄极寒，并号将军），补命门真火不足。性虽热而疏利大肠，与燥涩者不同（热药多秘，惟硫黄暖而能通；寒药多泄，惟黄连肥汤而止泻），若阳气暴绝，阳毒伤寒，久患寒泻，脾胃虚寒，命欲垂尽者用之，亦救危妙药也。治寒痹冷癖，足寒无力，老人虚秘（《局方》用半硫丸），妇人阴蚀，小儿慢惊。暖精壮阳，杀虫疗疮，辟鬼魅，化五金，能干汞（王好古曰∶太白丹、来复丹皆用硫黄佐以硝石∶至阳佐以至阳，与仲景白通汤佐以人尿、猪胆汁意同。所以治内伤生冷，外冒暑湿、霍乱诸病。能除扦格之寒，兼有伏阳，不得不尔。如无伏阳，只是阴虚，更不必以阴药佐之。《夷坚志》云∶唐与正亦知医，能以意治病。吴巡检病不得溲，卧则微通，立则不能涓滴，遍用通药不效。唐问其平日自制黑锡丹常服，因悟曰∶此必结砂时，硫飞去，铅不死，铅砂入膀胱，卧则偏重犹可溲，立则正塞水道故不通。取金液丹三百粒，分十服，瞿麦汤下，铅得硫则化，水道遂通。家母舅童时亦病溺涩，服通淋药罔效，老医黄五聚视之曰∶此乃外皮窍小，故溺时艰难，非淋症也。以牛骨作楔，塞于皮端，窍渐展开，勿药而愈。使重服通利药，得不更变他证乎？乃知医理非一端也。硫能化铅为水，修炼家尊之为金液丹）。番舶者良（难得）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113322-q9o07tl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113322-q9o07tl","updated":"20240611113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取色黄坚如石者，以莱菔剜空，入硫合定，糠火煨熟，去其臭气，以紫背浮萍煮过，消其火毒，以皂荚汤淘其黑浆。一法绢袋盛，酒煮三日夜。一法入猪大肠烂煮三时用。畏细辛、诸血、醋。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113322-q6kwv50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113322-q6kwv50","updated":"20240611113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"土硫黄辛热、腥臭，只可入疮药，不可服饵。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113245-dkaekrt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113245-dkaekrt"}},{"ID":"20240611113255-legw4e6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-legw4e6","updated":"20240611113300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-xfmw2m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-xfmw2m2","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，温、大热，有毒。主妇人阴蚀，疽痔，恶血，坚筋骨，除头秃，疗心腹积聚，邪气冷癖在胁，咳逆上气，脚冷疼弱无力，及鼻衄，恶疮，下部 疮，止血，杀疥虫。能化金、银、铜、铁奇物。生东海牧羊山谷中，及太山、河西山，矾石液也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-ujtkx3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-ujtkx3t","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶东海郡属北徐州，而箕山亦有。今第一出扶南林邑。色如鹅子初出壳，名昆仑黄。次出外国，从蜀中来，色深而煌煌。然方用之疗脚弱及痼冷，甚良。《仙经》颇用之。所化奇物并是《黄白术》及合丹法。此云矾石液，今南方则无矾石，恐不必尔。臣禹锡等谨案∶吴氏云∶硫黄一名石留黄。神农、黄帝、雷公∶咸，有毒。医和、扁鹊∶苦，无毒。或生易阳，或河西，或五色。黄是潘水石液也，烧令有紫焰者。八月、九月采。治妇人血结。药性论云∶石硫黄，君，有大毒。以黑锡煎汤解之，及食宿冷猪肉。味甘，太阳之精，鬼焰居焉，伏炼数般皆传于作者。能下气，治脚弱，腰肾久冷，除冷风顽痹。又云∶生用治疥癣，及疗寒热咳逆。炼服主虚损，泄精。箫炳云∶硫黄，臣。日华子云∶石亭脂、曾青为使，畏细辛、飞廉、铁。壮阳道，治 癖冷气，补筋骨劳损，风劳气，止嗽上气，及下部痔 ，恶疮疥癣，杀腹藏虫，邪魅等。煎余甘子汁，以御其毒也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-9qscgpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-9qscgpk","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶石硫黄，生东海牧羊山谷中，及泰山、河西山，矾石液也。今唯出南海诸蕃。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-qejhwp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-qejhwp5","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岭外州郡或有，而不甚佳。以色如鹅子初出壳者为真，谓之昆仑黄。其赤色者，名石亭脂，青色者号冬结石，半白半黑名神惊石，并不堪入药。又有一种土硫黄，出广南及荣州，溪涧水中流出。其味辛，性热腥臭。主治疥疮，杀虫毒。又可煎炼成汁，以摸 作器，亦如鹅子黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-yhubjn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-yhubjn0","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谨按古方书未有服饵硫黄者。《本经》所说功用，止于治疮蚀，攻积聚冷气，脚弱等。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-eaa299s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-eaa299s","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而近世遂火炼治为常服丸散，观其制炼服食之法，殊无本源，非若乳石之有论议节度，故服之，其效虽紧，而其患更速，可不戒之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-8o69fmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-8o69fmb","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海药谨案∶《广州记》云∶生昆仑日脚下，颗块莹净，无夹石者良。主风冷虚惫，肾冷，上气，腿膝虚羸，长肌肤，益气力，遗精，痔漏，老人风秘等。并宜烧炼服。仙方谓之黄 砂，能坏五金，亦能造作金色，人能制伏归本色，服而能除万病。如有发动，宜以猪肉、鸭羹、余甘子汤并解之。蜀中雅州亦出，光腻甚好，功力不及舶上来者。雷公云∶凡使，勿用青赤色及半白半青、半赤半黑者。自有黄色，内莹净似物命者，贵也。凡用四两，先以龙尾蒿自然汁一镒，东流水三镒，紫背天葵汁一镒，粟遂子茎汁一镒，四件合之搅令匀，一 埚用六一泥固济底下，将硫黄碎之入于埚中，以前件药汁旋旋添入，火煮之汁尽为度，了。再以百部末十两，柳末二斤，一簇草二斤，细锉之，以东流水并药等同煮硫黄二伏时，日满去诸药，取出用熟甘草汤洗了，入钵中研二万币方用。圣惠方∶治诸疮 肉如蛇出数寸。用硫黄一两细研，于肉上薄涂之，即便缩。外台秘要∶千金疗小儿 耳。硫黄末以粉耳中，日一夜一，瘥止。肘后方∶女子阴疮，末硫黄敷之。经验方∶大治元脏，气发久冷，腹痛虚泻，应急大效。玉粉丹∶生硫黄五两，青盐一两，以上衮细研，以蒸饼为丸如绿豆大。每服五丸，热酒空心服，以食压之。梅师方∶治阴生湿 疮。取石硫黄研如粉，敷疮上，日三度。博济方∶治阴阳二毒伤寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-jt68g3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-jt68g3v","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一口，先安硫黄铺铛底，次安巴豆，又以硫黄盖之，酽醋半升以来浇之，盏子盖合令紧密，更以湿纸周回固济缝，勿令透气缝，纸干更以醋湿之。文武火熬，常着人守之，候里面巴豆作声，数已半为度，即将铛子离火，便入臼中急捣令细。再以米醋些子，并蒸饼些小，再捣，令冷，可丸如鸡头大。若是阴毒，用椒四十九粒，葱白二茎，水一盏，煎至六分，服一丸；阳毒，用豆豉四十九粒，葱白二茎，水一盏同煎，吞一丸，不得嚼破。孙尚药∶治气虚伤冷，暴作水泻，日夜三、二十行，腹痛不止，夏月路行备急。朝真丹∶硫黄二两，牛角研令极细，枯白矾半两，同细研匀水浸，蒸饼去水脉了，和丸如梧桐子大，朱砂为衣。每服十五丸至二十丸，米饮、盐汤下。玉亟方∶王方平通灵王粉散∶洽腰膝，暖水脏，益颜色，其功不可具载。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-elojk5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-elojk5w","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以大火 之。如未伏更煮，以伏为度， 了，研为散，穿地坑一尺二寸，投水于中，待水清，取水和硫黄水，不得多，于 埚中，煎熬令如膏。及用铁钱一面，不着火上，以细砂隔纸，慢抄出硫黄于纸上滴之，自然如玉色，光彩射人，此号为玉粉散，细研，要丸以饭丸如麻子大。空心每日盐汤下十丸，散服亦盐汤调两字，极有效验。余乡人王昭遂合服之，年九十，颜貌如童，夜视细字，力倍常人。太清服炼灵砂法∶石硫黄本出波斯国，南明之境，禀纯阳火石之精气而结成，质性通流，含其猛毒。药品之中，号为将军。功能破邪归正，返滞还清，挺立阳精，消阴化魄。丹房镜源∶石硫黄，可干汞，诀曰∶此硫黄见五金而黑，得水银而赤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-l52oh7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-l52oh7l","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又曰黄牙。青霞子∶硫黄散癖。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113255-5wf6mki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113255-5wf6mki","updated":"20240611113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶石硫黄，今人用治下元虚冷，元气将绝，久患寒泄，脾胃虚弱，垂命欲尽，服之无不效。中病当便已，不可尽剂。世人盖知用而为福，不知用久为祸。此物损益兼行，若俱弃而不用，当仓猝之间，又可缺乎？或更以法制，拒火而又常服者，是亦弗思也。在《本经》则不言如此服食，但专治妇人。不知者，往往更以酒服，其可得乎？或脏中久冷，服之先利。如病热危急，可加丸数服，少则不效，仍如附子、干姜、桂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113228-dfzv0md","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113228-dfzv0md"}},{"ID":"20240611113236-2izp9d3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113236-2izp9d3","updated":"20240611113243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113236-f1va8uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113236-f1va8uj","updated":"20240611113236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气温，大热，味酸，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113236-dy98s5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113236-dy98s5t","updated":"20240611113236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主妇人阴蚀，疽痔，恶血。坚筋骨，除头秃。疗心腹积聚邪气，冷癖在胁，咳逆上气，脚冷疼弱无力，及鼻衄，恶疮，下部 疮。止血，杀疥虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113236-k9mmoka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113236-k9mmoka","updated":"20240611113236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《液》云∶如太白丹佐以硝石，来复丹用硝石之类，至阳佐以至阴，与仲景白通汤佐以人溺、猪胆汁，大意相同，所以去格拒之寒。兼有伏阳，不得不尔；如无伏阳，只是阴证，更不必以阴药佐之也。硫黄亦号将军，功能破邪归正，返滞还清，挺出阳精，消阴、化魄、生魂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113008-rnvgrin","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113008-rnvgrin"}},{"ID":"20240611113223-m66ygkf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113223-m66ygkf","updated":"20240611113227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113223-5gl18lx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113223-5gl18lx","updated":"20240611113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸咸大热，有毒。以莱菔挖空，入硫黄蒸熟用，或入豆腐中煮七次用，或醋用，或猪脏中制用，各随本方。硫是矾之液，矾是铁之精，磁石是铁之母，故针砂磁石，制入硫黄，立成紫粉，硫能干汞，见五金而黑，得水银则赤也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113223-ekukvvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113223-ekukvvj","updated":"20240611113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主妇人阴蚀疽痔恶血，坚筋骨，除头秃。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113223-v6kvs0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113223-v6kvs0n","updated":"20240611113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄禀纯阳之精，赋大热之性，助命门相火不足。寒郁火邪，胃脘结痛，脚冷疼弱者宜之。其性虽热，而能疏利大肠，与燥涩之性不同。但久服伤阴，大肠受伤，多致便血。伤寒阴毒爪甲纯青，火焰散屡奏神功。阴水腹胀，水道不通，金液丹服之即效。《本经》治阴蚀疽痔乃热因热用，以散阴中蕴积之垢热，但热邪亢盛者禁用。又言坚筋骨者，取以治下部之寒湿。若湿热痿痹，良非所宜。人身阴常不足，阳常有余，苟非真病虚寒，胡可服此毒热类。按；有久服硫黄，人渐缩小之例，石顽亲见李尧占服此数年，临毙缩小如七八岁童子状。正《内经》所谓热则骨消筋缓是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113034-zvxtuso","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113034-zvxtuso"}},{"ID":"20240611113039-vf84s3x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113039-vf84s3x","updated":"20240611113043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113039-shrnkar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113039-shrnkar","updated":"20240611113039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大燥、补阳、杀虫．"}]},{"ID":"20240611113039-u6x9w2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113039-u6x9w2t","updated":"20240611113039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸有毒．大热纯阳．（硫黄阳精极热、与大黄极寒、并号将军．）补命门真火不足．性虽热而疏利大肠．与燥涩者不同．（热药多秘、唯硫黄暖而能通．）若阳气暴绝．阴毒伤寒．久患寒泻．脾胃虚寒．命欲垂绝者用之．亦救危妙药也．治寒痹冷癖．足寒无力．老人虚秘．（局方有半硫丸．）妇人阴蚀．小儿慢惊．暖精壮阳．杀虫疗疮．辟鬼魅．化五金．能干汞．（硫黄纯阳、炼制久服、则有偏胜之害、况服食者、又皆假此纵欲、自速其咎、于药何责、孙升谈圃云∶硫黄大热、火炼服之、多发背疽、泊宅编云∶金液丹乃硫黄炼成、纯阳之物、有痼冷者所宜、今夏月人多服之、反生火害．夷坚志云∶唐与正亦知医、能以意治病、吴巡检、病不得溲、卧则微通、立则不能涓滴、遍用通药不效、唐闻其平日自制黑锡丹常服、因悟曰∶此必结砂时、硫飞去、铅不死、铅砂入膀胱、卧则偏重、犹可溲、立则正塞水道、故不通、取金液丹三百粒、分十服、瞿麦汤下、铅得硫则化、水道遂利、家母舅童时、亦病溺涩、服通淋药罔效、老医黄五聚视之、曰∶此乃外皮窍小、故溺时艰阻、非淋证也、以牛骨作屑、塞于皮端、窍渐展开、使重服通利药、得不更变他证乎．硫能化铅为水、修炼家尊之为金液丹．）用之得当．兼以制炼得宜．淫房断绝者能之．一有不当．贻祸匪轻．番舶者良．（最难得．）取色黄如石者．以莱菔剜空．入硫合定．糠火煨熟．去其臭气．以紫背浮萍煮过．消其火毒．以皂荚汤淘其黑浆．一法、绢袋盛．酒煮三日夜．一法、入猪大肠．烂煮三时．畏细辛、醋、诸血．土硫黄、辛热腥臭．止可入疮药．不可服饵．"}]},{"ID":"20240611113504-fmhedu6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113504-fmhedu6","updated":"20240611113504"}},{"ID":"20240611113504-g4x7irv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113504-g4x7irv","updated":"20240611113504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113504-mxvcef6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113504-mxvcef6","updated":"20240611113504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，温、大热，有毒。主妇人阴蚀，疽痔，恶血，坚筋骨，除头秃。疗心腹积聚，邪气冷癖在胁，咳逆上气，脚冷疼弱无力，及鼻衄，恶疮，下部生疮，止血，杀疥虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113504-fxmd61c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113504-fxmd61c","updated":"20240611113504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能化金银铜铁奇物。生东海牧羊山谷中，及太山、河西山，矾石液也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113504-w2gzs2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113504-w2gzs2s","updated":"20240611113504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"东海郡属北徐州，而箕山亦有。今第一出扶南林邑，色如鹅子初出壳，名昆仑黄。次出外国，从蜀中来，色深而煌煌。俗方用之疗脚弱及痼冷甚良。《仙经》颇用之。所化奇物，并是《黄白术》及合丹法。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113504-d7nmzjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113504-d7nmzjx","updated":"20240611113504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此云矾石液，今南方则无矾石，恐不必尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113008-kbw9dr5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113008-kbw9dr5"}},{"ID":"20240611113022-w0uvl7v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113022-w0uvl7v","updated":"20240611113026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《中药炮制》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113022-6szat9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113022-6szat9c","updated":"20240611113022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『来源』本品为斜方晶系硫黄的矿石或从含硫矿物提制而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113022-1isz38f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113022-1isz38f","updated":"20240611113022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『炮制』拣去杂质，捣碎，为减低毒性，便于服用，与豆腐加水同煮，至硫黄烊化，豆腐呈绿色浮在上面为度，取出，漂去豆腐，阴干研粉备用。每10斤硫黄，用豆腐20斤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113022-zxao6tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113022-zxao6tc","updated":"20240611113022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『用量』0．5～2克，外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113022-76fjn61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113022-76fjn61","updated":"20240611113022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『贮存』瓦缸装，置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113009-5gtmlpg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611113009-5gtmlpg"}},{"ID":"20240611113010-5dtyk6l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611113010-5dtyk6l","updated":"20240611113013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611113010-zsq36ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113010-zsq36ur","updated":"20240611113010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用纯黄者。杂他色不可用主治。助消化。祛积聚。止血。杀疥虫。痢疾。壮阳。向为服食者所珍。然易中毒。不可信。中硫黄毒。白羊生热血一碗服之。神效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113010-yh5bug5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113010-yh5bug5","updated":"20240611113010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫艾汤。倭硫黄三钱。艾汤下。治阴证伤寒极冷厥逆烦躁腹痛无脉危极。服之得睡。汗出解。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113010-pkm9s6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113010-pkm9s6p","updated":"20240611113010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄不二散。硫黄一钱。靛花一分。研末凉水一杯调服。治梅毒发于咽喉。腐烂疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611113010-8wrsph8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611113010-8wrsph8","updated":"20240611113010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汤水难入者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112939-r4tta27","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112939-r4tta27"}},{"ID":"20240611112958-gkyxtte","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112958-gkyxtte","updated":"20240611113003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112958-3kq3zkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112958-3kq3zkz","updated":"20240611112958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，性温，入足太阴脾、足少阴肾、足厥阴肝经。驱寒燥湿，补火壮阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112958-ks7w1fy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112958-ks7w1fy","updated":"20240611112958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫黄温燥水土、驱逐湿寒，治虚劳咳嗽、呕吐泄利、衄血便红、冷气寒瘕、腰软膝痛、阳痿精滑、痈疽痔瘘、疥癣癞秃。敷女子阴痒，洗玉门宽冷，涂齄疣耵耳，消胬肉顽疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112958-k7b0dhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112958-k7b0dhb","updated":"20240611112958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入萝菔内，稻糠火煨熟，去其臭气，研细用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112958-fv7qr85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112958-fv7qr85","updated":"20240611112958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硝石能化硫为水，以竹筒盛埋马粪中，一月成水，名硫黄液。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112940-44215sy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112940-44215sy"}},{"ID":"20240611112947-2focr0p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112947-2focr0p","updated":"20240611112952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112947-k5rrv3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112947-k5rrv3h","updated":"20240611112947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气温，大热，味酸，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112947-i0vvk8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112947-i0vvk8n","updated":"20240611112947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主妇人阴蚀，疽痔，恶血。坚筋骨，除头秃。疗心腹积聚邪气，冷癖在胁，咳逆上气，脚冷疼弱无力，及鼻衄，恶疮，下部 疮。止血，杀疥虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112947-zi4kf8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112947-zi4kf8v","updated":"20240611112947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《液》云∶如太白丹佐以硝石，来复丹用硝石之类，至阳佐以至阴，与仲景白通汤佐以人溺、猪胆汁，大意相同，所以去格拒之寒。兼有伏阳，不得不尔；如无伏阳，只是阴证，更不必以阴药佐之也。硫黄亦号将军，功能破邪归正，返滞还清，挺出阳精，消阴、化魄、生魂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112926-7vq6crn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112926-7vq6crn"}},{"ID":"20240611112933-pzw4ckm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112933-pzw4ckm","updated":"20240611112938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112933-2kgxd0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112933-2kgxd0e","updated":"20240611112933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄，味酸，气温、大热，有毒。至阳之精，入肾。能化五金奇物，壮兴阳道，益下焦虚冷，元气将绝者甚效。禁止寒泻，或脾胃衰微，垂命欲死者立效。坚筋骨，去心腹 癖，却脚膝冷疼，仍除格拒之寒。此物纯阳，专伏纯阴之气，化魄生魂，破邪归正，其功甚巨，故有将军之号。然而，其性大热，用之不得其宜，亦必祸生不测，必须制伏始佳。此物用寒水石制之大妙，世人未知也，硫黄十两，研为末，加入寒水石一两，亦研为末，和在一处，以水化之，寒水化而硫黄不化也，候其水干，然后取出用之，自无他患。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112933-zlv0wft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112933-zlv0wft","updated":"20240611112933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或疑硫黄大热，寒水大凉，取之相制，似乎得宜，然而用硫黄正取其纯阳也，以寒水制之，阳不变为阴乎？不知寒水制硫黄，非制其热，制其毒也。去毒则硫黄性纯，但有功而无过，可用之而得其宜也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112810-s3za43e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112810-s3za43e"}},{"ID":"20240611112922-xyhagst","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-xyhagst","updated":"20240611112929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫磺《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-9dbi3ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-9dbi3ei","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦称硫磺、黄硇砂、黄牙、阳侯、将军。（“磺”原作为“黄”）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-si8ppac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-si8ppac","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」酸、温、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-v8eics1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-v8eics1","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-4uc9fxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-4uc9fxf","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、腰膝寒冷无力。用硫磺半斤，放在桑枝灰五斗的淋汁中，煮三沸。假干，以大火煅后研细。另取地坑里清水（穿地约一尺二寸，投水其中，等澄清后取用）和上述的硫磺末在坩锅中熬成膏子。再加米饭揉匀做成丸子，如麻子大。每服十丸，空心服，盐汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-qef7hfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-qef7hfo","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、脚气病。用硫磺粉三两、钟乳粉五升，加水煮沸，煎成三升。每服三合。又方：牛乳三升，煎至一升半。取五合，调硫磺粉一两。一次服下，蒙被而卧，须出汁为好，注意避风。如不出汗，再服药一次。隔几天之后，又照此服药。如此几次，可见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-wk3bh04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-wk3bh04","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、伤寒阴症（极冷，厥逆烦燥，腹痛脉微）。煎艾汤服硫磺末三钱。安卧，出汗自愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-7b46iu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-7b46iu1","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、积块作痛。用硫磺、硝石、结砂、青皮、陈皮各四两，共研为末，加面糊成丸子，如梧子大。每服三十丸，空心服，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-fopt86e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-fopt86e","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、气虚暴泄，日夜二、三十次，腹痛不止。用硫磺二两，枯矾半两，共研为末，加蒸饼糊成丸子，丹砂为衣，如梧子大。每服十五至二十丸，温水或盐汤送下。此方名“朝真丹”，暑天可旅行宜备。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-qa2bvb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-qa2bvb8","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、霍乱吐泻。用硫磺一两、胡椒五钱，共研为末，加黄蜡一两，熔化调丸，如皂角子大。每服一丸，凉水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-kozwe5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-kozwe5d","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、脾虚下白（脾胃虚冷，停水停气，凝成白涕下出）。用硫磺一两、炒面粉一分，共研为末，滴水糊成丸子，如梧子大。每服五十丸，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-yjmci0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-yjmci0h","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、老人时泄时秘，交替出现。用硫磺、半夏（热水泡七次，焙干）等分，研细，与生姜汁、蒸饼和在一起捣匀，做成丸子，如梧子大。每服十五至二十丸，空心服，温酒或姜汤上。妇女用醋汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-2cupsgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-2cupsgj","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、红白痢。用硫磺、蛤粉，等分为末，加糊为丸，如梧子大。每服十五丸，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-ed4h218","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-ed4h218","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、久疟不止。用硫磺、丹砂，等分为末，每服二钱。发病日清晨服。寒多则硫磺用量加倍，热多则丹砂且量加倍。又方：硫磺、蜡茶，等分为末。每服二钱，冷水送下，发病日清晨服。寒多则增加硫磺用量，热多则增加蜡茶用量。服药二次后可见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-jrmis5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-jrmis5u","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、肾虚头痛。用硫磺一两，加胡粉为末，和饭做成丸子，如梧子大。痛时，以冷水送服五丸。又方：硫磺末、食盐等分，水调生面糊药成丸子，如梧子大。每服五丸，加蒸饼糊成丸子，如梧子大。每服三至五丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-vbj7n6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-vbj7n6y","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、酒鼻。用生硫磺半两、杏仁二钱、水银粉一钱，共研为末，每夜搽鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-ealkmps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-ealkmps","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13、小儿耳。用硫磺末和蜡作成捻子插在耳中。一天换两次。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-4umcivv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-4umcivv","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14、突然耳聋。用硫磺、雄黄，等分为末，棉花裹着塞耳内，数日可愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-sw1b2at","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-sw1b2at","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15、一切恶疮。用好硫磺三两、荞麦粉二两，共研为末，滴水，捏成饼，晒干收存。临用时，取饼研细，以水调匀敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112922-3u5q399","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112922-3u5q399","updated":"20240611112922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16、疥疮有虫。用油煎鸡蛋和硫磺粉调匀搽疮上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112811-lp6bge3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112811-lp6bge3"}},{"ID":"20240611112910-w9v4vom","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112910-w9v4vom","updated":"20240611112915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112910-ldgrxcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112910-ldgrxcn","updated":"20240611112910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸辛咸热．补肾火以助元阳．救逆扶危．润大肠可疏风闭．冷癖阴凝之证．内服则用以宣通．虫疮疥癞诸方．外治则取其毒烈．（硫黄有二种．一种石硫黄．出外番山谷间．秉阳火之气．由石液结成．凡产石硫黄之处．必有温泉作硫黄气．一种土硫黄．出广南煤圹中．以法熬炼而成．其色带青．其气带臭．碾之有声．只可作疮药火药之用．若服食之方．用以扶危济急．拯逆返元．皆宜以石者为上．辛酸咸热有毒之品．用不得宜．或过用偏胜之害．祸如反掌．硫黄火之精也．暖而能通．入肾与命门大肠．回阳破阴之功．自非浅鲜．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112811-q4ew80o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112811-q4ew80o"}},{"ID":"20240611112816-25z4z9b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112816-25z4z9b","updated":"20240611112820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112816-7cym3px","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112816-7cym3px","updated":"20240611112816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄甘酸性大热，杀诸疮虫燥脓血，壮肾阳气暖肺脾，涩精治痹除呃噎。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112816-ofmvar6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112816-ofmvar6","updated":"20240611112816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫，流也。助焰硝成火药，流而不返。又硫乃石之液，火之精也。有毒。疗疽痔恶疮，头秃，下部 疮，妇人阴蚀，一切疥癣，诸疮， 肉，恶血。杀虫及腹脏诸虫。暖肾壮阳，脚冷疼弱光力，筋骨顽痹，下元虚冷，泄精冷秘。又治脾寒久泻，心腹 癖积聚及肺胃俱冷，咳逆上气，鼻衄，一切脾肾元气欲绝，服之皆验。中病即已，不可过剂。能化金银铜铁奇物。《液》云∶来复丹用硝石之类，至阳佐以至阴，与白通汤佐以人溺、猪胆汁大意相同。所以去拒格之寒，兼有伏阳，不得不尔。如无伏阳，不必以阴药佐之也。出广州舶上，矾石液也。色黄莹净者佳，凡使，溶化入麻油中，或入童便中浸七日，细研水飞，入痼冷药，以雀脑髓拌之则不臭。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112816-7wbhfab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112816-7wbhfab","updated":"20240611112816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一法∶硫黄四两，用白矾半斤，入瓦罐内，以豆腐浆煮一日，去水慢火熬干，令结成一块。次日挖地坑埋一瓦罐，内贮米醋一碗，另用铁叶一片，钻十数孔于上，盖定罐口，却取前硫黄罐子覆铁叶上，两口相对，外以盐泥封固，候干，以炭火 三炷香久，其白矾粘于上罐，硫黄溜于下罐醋内，候冷取出，水浸一宿，阴干，研用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112816-xt57l9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112816-xt57l9i","updated":"20240611112816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青为使。畏细辛、铁。又土硫黄，出广南荣州，溪涧水中流出。味辛、热，腥臭。主疮疥，杀蛊毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112648-3w04zrl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112648-3w04zrl"}},{"ID":"20240611112759-we1pp1j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-we1pp1j","updated":"20240611112807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫黄《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-9rqscmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-9rqscmn","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为天然硫黄矿或含硫矿物的提炼品。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-sy57uu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-sy57uu3","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】酸，温。有毒。入肾、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-q01eq2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-q01eq2s","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】杀虫，补火助阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-t6sy3fi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-t6sy3fi","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1、用于疥癣，阴疽等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-rt45n9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-rt45n9f","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品有以毒攻毒的作用，且有杀虫之功，对于疥癣，可配伍轻粉，大风子等同用；还可外敷阴疽，有消散的功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-hzlnzmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-hzlnzmr","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、用于命门火衰，腰酸膝冷，阳痿，以及肾气不纳所致的喘逆和虚寒腹痛等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-dnekdiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-dnekdiv","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品有补火助阳之功，对命门火衰所致的腰酸、阳痿，及虚寒腹痛等症，可与附子、肉桂等配合应用；治疗肾气不纳的喘逆，可配合黑锡、补骨脂、葫芦巴等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-i46rjtl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-i46rjtl","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，本品还可用于虚寒便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-ccjop6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-ccjop6j","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】硫黄（与豆腐同煮后用）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-vw6c2i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-vw6c2i8","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一日量三分至八分，入丸、散。外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-1540e4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-1540e4i","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】半硫丸《和剂局方》：半夏、硫黄、姜汁。治虚寒便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-weuv62l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-weuv62l","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主妇人阴蚀，疽痔，恶血，坚筋骨，除头秃。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-sk56w4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-sk56w4a","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性本草》：「能下气，治脚弱腰肾久冷，除冷风顽痹。」又云：「生用治疥癣，及疗寒热咳逆。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611112759-6yxb2c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112759-6yxb2c7","updated":"20240611112759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草图解》：「主命门火衰，阳气暴绝，阴证伤寒，阳道痿弱，老人虚秘，妇入血结，虚寒久痢，心腹积聚。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611112648-9wrza82","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112648-9wrza82"}},{"ID":"20240611112729-43notqo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-43notqo","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：硫黄"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-eclx3hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-eclx3hb","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-r8wnjf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-r8wnjf1","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Liú Huánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-lwviic8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-lwviic8","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-hqtvu1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-hqtvu1d","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 硫磺、黄牙、天生黄"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-2ang1e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-2ang1e2","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-b9mshbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-b9mshbc","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" SULFUR"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-hw9v24h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-hw9v24h","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-3lf19pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-3lf19pf","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为自然元素类矿物硫族"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"自然硫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，采挖后，加热熔化，除去杂质；或用含硫矿物经加工制得。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-r1tgqtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-r1tgqtp","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-wu2qm1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-wu2qm1i","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈不规则块状。黄色或略呈绿黄色。表面不平坦，呈脂肪光泽，常有多数小孔。用手握紧置于耳旁，可闻轻微的爆裂声。体轻，质松，易碎，断面常呈针状结晶形。有特异的臭气，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-g5dlu2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-g5dlu2b","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-qki64qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-qki64qe","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处，防火。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-mlvbr34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-mlvbr34","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-o1tzab7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-o1tzab7","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"硫黄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：除去杂质，敲成碎块。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-3u8cs3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-3u8cs3j","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"制硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：取净硫黄块，与豆腐同煮，至豆腐显黑绿色时，取出，漂净，阴干。每100kg硫黄，用豆腐200kg 。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-k8td8dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-k8td8dv","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-tlvopc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-tlvopc0","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品燃烧时易熔融，火焰为蓝色，并有二氧化硫的刺激性臭气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-sd7loef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-sd7loef","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-saq6bzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-saq6bzr","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肾、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-qp7cjfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-qp7cjfr","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-c4ps7em","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-c4ps7em","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸，温；有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-0unqba4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-0unqba4","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-p7gstuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-p7gstuf","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-89av7ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-89av7ul","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-e1r0we1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-e1r0we1","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用解毒杀虫疗疮；内服补火助阳通便。外治用于疥癣，秃疮，阴疽恶疮；内服用于阳痿足冷，虚喘冷哮，虚寒便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-8vlfwas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-8vlfwas","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-gsr4ntb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-gsr4ntb","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用适量，研末油调涂敷患处。内服1.5～3g,炮制后入丸散服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-02ojbkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-02ojbkr","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-orounui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-orounui","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天生黄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为天然升华硫磺。呈不规则砂状结晶或颗粒状，大小不等，黄绿色，微有玻璃样光泽。质较硫磺纯净，其性味、功能、主治与硫磺相似。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-b3md9vp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-b3md9vp","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-cgyi7sp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-cgyi7sp","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ehjlf9r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ehjlf9r","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：硫黄"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-gyvt0io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-gyvt0io","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-pqq6yi8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-pqq6yi8","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Liú Huánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-03lmr4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-03lmr4y","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-pcm99ps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-pcm99ps","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石流黄（《范子计然》），石留黄、硫黄（《吴普本草》），昆仑黄（陶弘景），黄牙（《丹房鉴源》），黄硇砂（《海药本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-bz11fq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-bz11fq7","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-groewjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-groewjs","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-5v0vtci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-5v0vtci","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-un3pvl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-un3pvl9","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"硫黄矿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"含硫矿物冶炼而成"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。将泥块状的硫黄及矿石，在坑内用素烧罐加热熔化，取其上层之硫黄溶液，倒入模型内，冷却后，取出。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-707790o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-707790o","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-uya484c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-uya484c","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 产山西、陕西、河南、山东、湖北、湖南、江苏、四川、广东、台湾等地。。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-s6twbg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-s6twbg3","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-wgrfvhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-wgrfvhw","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 斜方晶系。晶体的锥面发达，偶而呈厚板状。常见者为致密块状、钟乳状、被膜状、土状等。颜色有黄、浅黄、淡绿黄、灰黄、褐色和黑色等。条痕白色至浅黄色。晶面具金刚光泽，断口呈脂肪光泽。半透明。解理不完全。断口呈贝壳状或参差状。硬度1～2。比重2.05～2.08。性脆。为良好的绝缘体。以手握紧置于耳旁，可闻轻微的爆裂声。在108℃时即熔化，270℃时燃烧。常见于温泉、喷泉、火山口区域；沉积岩中亦常有之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-q1d7uoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-q1d7uoj","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-tlrw5a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-tlrw5a5","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为不规则的块状，大小不一。呈黄色，或带浅绿色或浅棕黄色。表面不平坦，常有麻纹及细砂孔；有光泽，半透明。体轻，质脆易碎。断面常呈粗针状结晶形。有特异之臭气，味淡。以色黄，光亮、松脆、无杂质者为佳。燃之易熔融，发蓝色火焰，并放出刺激性的二氧化硫臭气。不溶于水及盐酸、硫酸；遇硝酸或王水被氧化成硫酸；溶于二硫化碳、煤袖及松节油中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-9oy0xm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-9oy0xm7","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-smu5iwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-smu5iwz","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 纯品主要含硫，并含碲与硒。商品中有杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-78tf2ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-78tf2ff","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-pxzibuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-pxzibuv","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 硫黄本身不活泼，内服后变为硫化物或硫化氢，刺激胃肠粘膜，使之兴奋蠕动，导致下泻。此过程需要有碱性环境、大肠杆菌、特别是脂肪分解酶的存在。肠内容中，脂肪性物质较多时，易产生大量硫化氢而致泻。空气中硫化氢浓度过高，可直接麻痹中枢神经细胞而导致死亡。硫化物局部应用，有溶解角质及脱毛（硫化钡）作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-736gf1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-736gf1x","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-kbxc6vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-kbxc6vd","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生硫磺：去净杂质，砸成小块。制硫黄：取拣净的硫黄块，与豆腐同煮，至豆腐现黑绿色为度，取出，漂去豆腐，阴干。（每硫黄10斤，用豆腐20斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-2yhb5pt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-2yhb5pt","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《纲目》：\"凡用硫黄，入丸散用须以萝卜剜空，入硫在内，合定，稻糠火煨熟，去其臭气；以紫背浮萍同煮过，消其火毒；以皂荚汤淘之，去其黑浆。一法：打碎以绢袋盛，用无灰酒煮三伏时用。又消石能化硫为水，以竹筒盛硫埋马粪中一月，亦成水，名硫黄液。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-lg2yz0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-lg2yz0y","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-jlse3vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-jlse3vu","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肾、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-wag4swk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-wag4swk","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入命门经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-adhq5zq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-adhq5zq","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入手厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-o8iwv41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-o8iwv41","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《玉楸药解》：\"入足太阴脾、足少阴肾，足厥阴肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-kcz5yb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-kcz5yb6","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-atllhmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-atllhmk","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸，热，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-zxwilx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-zxwilx7","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味酸，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-f4p6myr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-f4p6myr","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"神农、黄帝、雷公：咸，有毒。医和、扁鹊：无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-f4t90a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-f4t90a1","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》；\"大热，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-v7p60li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-v7p60li","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论》：\"味甘，有大毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-civ604g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-civ604g","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-g5e5v7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-g5e5v7m","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴虚火旺及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-y1h3hw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-y1h3hw1","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药对》：\"曾青为之使。畏细辛、飞廉、朴硝、铁、醋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-pl3jw4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-pl3jw4x","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"久服伤阴，大肠受伤，多致便血；湿热瘙痹，良非所宜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-21tv3ba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-21tv3ba","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ts7wj1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ts7wj1q","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 壮阳，杀虫。治阳痿，虚寒泻痢，大便冷秘；外用治疥癣，湿疹，癞疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-07awqng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-07awqng","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主妇人阴蚀，疽痔恶血，坚筋骨，除头秃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-4i8kcve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-4i8kcve","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗心腹积聚，邪气，冷癣在胁，咳逆上气，脚冷疼弱无力，及鼻衄恶疮，下部匿疮，止血，杀疥虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-qs373n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-qs373n6","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"除冷风，顽痹。生用治疥癣及疗寒热咳逆，炼服主虚损泄精。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-5iohhne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-5iohhne","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《海药本草》：\"主遗精痔漏，老人风秘等。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-tanux1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-tanux1l","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"杀腹脏虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-asyhgoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-asyhgoe","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"主虚寒久痢滑泄，霍乱，补命门不足，阳气暴绝，阴毒伤寒，小儿慢惊。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-xi3sjms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-xi3sjms","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《纲目拾遗》：\"天生磺，治膈症。\"\"舶上硫黄，灭斑，杀虫，治疮通血，止泻痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-0lgwfxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-0lgwfxb","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-irx010z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-irx010z","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：研末，0.5～1钱，或入丸、散。外用：研末撒，调敷或磨汁涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-5k61ky4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-5k61ky4","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-zzhvmvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-zzhvmvf","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治男子腰肾久冷，心腹积聚，胁下冷癣，腹中诸虫，失精遗溺，形羸力劣，脚膝疼弱，冷风顽痹，霍乱转筋，虚滑下利；又治妇人血结寒热，阴蚀疽痔：硫黄十两。净拣去沙石，研细飞过，用瓷盒子盛，以水和赤石脂封口，以盐泥固济晒干，地内先埋一小罐子，盛水令满，安合子在上，用泥固济讫，慢火养七日七夜，侯足，加顶火一斤煅，侯冷取出，研为细末，以药末一两，用蒸饼一两，汤浸握去水，搜为丸，如梧桐子大。每服三十丸，多至百丸，温米饮下，空心服之。（《局方》金液丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-qfr2y0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-qfr2y0v","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治阴毒面色青，四肢逆冷，心躁腹痛：硫黄末，新汲水调下二钱，良久，或寒一起，或热一起，更看紧慢，再服，汗出差。（《本事方》还阳散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-q0iwebx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-q0iwebx","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治脾虚下白，脾胃虚冷，停水滞气，凝成白涕下出：舶上硫黄一两（研末），炒面一分。同研，滴冷热水丸梧子大。每米汤下五十丸。（《杨氏护命方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-5cv7f2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-5cv7f2c","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治水泻不止，伤冷虚极：硫黄一两。研细，先熔黄蜡，入硫黄末打匀，丸如梧桐子大，每履五丸，新汲水下，（《圣济总录》黄蜡丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-qghqt3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-qghqt3q","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治心腹一切痃癖冷气，及年高风秘、冷秘或泄泻等：硫黄（明净好者，研令极细，用柳木槌子杀过）、半夏（汤浸七次，焙干，为细末）。上等分，以生姜自然汁同熬，入干蒸讲末搅和匀，入臼内杵数百下，丸如梧桐子大。每服空心温酒或生姜汤下十五丸至廿丸，妇人醋汤下。（《局方》半硫丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-354zyx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-354zyx1","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治胃气，冷痛尤效：元胡索、胡椒、五灵脂、白豆蔻各五钱，硫黄一两，木香（切片、晒干）二钱五分。研细末，拌匀收贮，体壮者服一分，弱者八厘，老人幼童五厘，取温烧酒半小盅调服，待次日，吃稀米汤，至五日后方可吃干饭。孕妇忌服。（《经验广集》剪根丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-m1umxh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-m1umxh1","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治卒得疥疮：麻油摩硫黄涂之。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-jwm33dt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-jwm33dt","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治一切干湿癣：石硫黄半钱，风化石灰半两，铅丹二钱，腻粉一钱。同研如粉，用生油调，先以布揩破癣涂之。未涂药间，煎葱白、甘草汤淋洗，如换时亦依此。（《圣济总录》如圣散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-sb9oili","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-sb9oili","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治慢性湿疹，神经性皮炎：硫黄一两，银珠一钱，陈醋半斤。将硫黄放在铁勺内熔化后，放入银珠拌匀，在地上挖个二至三寸深的坑，将醋和溶化的硫黄液先后倒在坑内，等凝固后取出再熔化，如此处理三次，捣细粉，用植物油调匀，以布包药搽患处，一日两次。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-9seye9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-9seye9u","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治疠风：硫黄末，酒调少许，饮汁，或加大枫子油更好。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-jci3ant","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-jci3ant","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治疬疡风病，白色成片：以布拭醋，磨硫黄、附子涂之，或硫黄、白矾擦之。（《姚僧坦集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-g48wy6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-g48wy6s","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治阴生湿疱疮：石硫黄，研如粉，敷疮上，日三度。（《梅师集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-deqfho0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-deqfho0","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治小儿聤耳：末石碱黄，以粉耳中，日一夜一。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-y7k8bom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-y7k8bom","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治咳逆打呃：硫黄，烧烟熏之。（《医方摘要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-h2gkyub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-h2gkyub","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治酒皶赤鼻：舶上硫黄、鸡心槟榔等分，片脑少许。为末，绢包，日日擦之，加蓖麻油更妙。（《瑞竹堂经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-9kda02r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-9kda02r","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治耳聋：硫黄、雄黄各等分。为末，绵裹纳耳中。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-h5an3bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-h5an3bc","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治烫伤，烧伤，能止痛，抗感染，保护创面，促进愈合：硫黄，烧酒。将硫黄粉碎放入磁器内（不可用金属容器），兑入烧酒，以没过硫黄为度。把酒点着烧成炭灰色。因酒含有水分，如烧后还余水分，可用慢火将硫磺烤干，然后研面，用时撒于患部。如有水泡，将水泡挑破再上药粉。（辽宁省《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-nokezsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-nokezsg","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-iqwh1yv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-iqwh1yv","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗慢性气管炎"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-1edrwbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-1edrwbf","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取硫黄1斤，绿豆（磨碎，布包）1斤，加水煮2～3小时，至硫黄成松泡状时，取出绿豆，使硫黄干燥，研粉。每次1克，日服1～2次，20天为一疗程。治疗213例，临床治愈40例（18.7％），显效95例（44.6％）。部分病例做了肝、肾功能，及心电图、血常规检查，均未发现明显的异常改变。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-y9qnj7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-y9qnj7r","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗蛲虫"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-unr29lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-unr29lf","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取硫黄粉内服，2～5岁每次0.3克，6～7岁0.5克，每天3次，进餐时服；同时每天洗涤肛门1次，并用硫黄粉扑于肛门及其周围。治疗57例，用药2周后，51例连续3天做虫卵和成虫检查，结果转阴者26例，治愈率为60.98％。在治疗期间无不良反应出现。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-va4plku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-va4plku","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗红皮病"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ewroq3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ewroq3k","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采用硫黄发热疗法，治疗原发性红皮病，即威-勃氏红皮病及续发性红皮病（续发于寻常性干癣、脂溢性湿疹、毛发红糠疹等）共7例，病期自40～150天不等，均治愈或好转。治法：以2露硫黄油悬液行肌肉注射，开始用0.2毫升注射于臀部，以后视机体反应情况每次增加0.2毫升，最大可增至2毫升。10～15次为一疗程，疗程间休息1～2周，视病情需要可注射3～5个疗程。治疗时间最短者28天，最长者80天。为了防止疼痛，宜先在臀部肌注1～2％普鲁卡因溶液后再注射本药。禁忌症：㈠全身衰弱或营养不良；㈡活动性肺结核及糖尿病；㈢心脏病及高血压；㈣肝肾功能障碍；㈤血液病；㈥孕妇及50岁以上的病人。硫黄发热疗法治疗红皮病所需的发热次数和剂量应视个体的不同情况而定，剂量应以维持最高热度为宜，不宜迅速增至最高量。此法较其它发热疗法热度高，热型规则，持续时间长。发热潜伏期平均为6～8小时，其后体温即直线上升，最高热度可达39.5～41℃，平均高热持续时间8～12小时。高热前后可出现寒战、头痛、头晕、口渴、不思饮食、四肢困倦及关节疼痛等副作用，须加强护理，调整饮食，充分饮水，亦可静注50％葡萄糖液20～40毫升。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-uh9pgpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-uh9pgpn","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗阴囊、阴唇湿痒"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-fdjtzdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-fdjtzdg","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采用硫黄烟熏疗法。取硫黄1钱左右，放入磁杯内，用棉花搓成捻子，蘸油少许插入硫黄中，点燃捻子。直接烟熏阴阜部分（用被单围住下身，以免烟气外泄），每次1小时左右。每日或隔日1次，一般3～4次即见效。治疗5例，皆愈。熏后阴囊或两腿内侧起紫红色瘢痕，不必用药，几天后即可消失。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-n4t5d78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-n4t5d78","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ikrfw2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ikrfw2a","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 此外，尚有天生碘和舶上硫黄二种商品："}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-6o8duwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-6o8duwn","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①天生磺（《纲目拾遗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-np9wvmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-np9wvmw","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"系含硫温泉处升华凝结于岩石上者，收集后，先用冷水洗去泥土，再用热水烫7～10余次，然后放在香油内，捞取浮于表面者。本品为浅黄色粉末，少有呈碎片状，闪烁发光，有臭气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-l3mkn0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-l3mkn0l","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②舶上硫黄（《博济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-8jqsvlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-8jqsvlr","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：舶硫（《遵生八笺》），白硫黄（《百草镜》）。系将硫黄提炼而成。商品为不规则的块状，全体鲜黄色，半透明，有玻璃样光泽。体轻而脆，易碎，断面不平坦。有臭气，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-wobx0aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-wobx0aw","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ql1uy8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ql1uy8e","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-o2z8x3c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-o2z8x3c","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：硫黄"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-rjgc732","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-rjgc732","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-spgibfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-spgibfx","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Liú Huánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-mgbjhl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-mgbjhl7","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ecbh1k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ecbh1k9","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石硫黄、石流黄、流黄、石留黄、昆仑黄、黄牙、黄英、烦硫、石亭脂、九灵黄童、山石住、黄硇砂、将军、白硫黄、天生黄、硫黄花、硫黄粉"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-1y830qc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-1y830qc","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-6bfbwrp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-6bfbwrp","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 硫黄首载于《本经》，原名石硫黄，列为中品。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-hdz737f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-hdz737f","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1．《本草经集注》云：“今第一出扶南(今柬埔寨)、林邑(今越南)。色如鹅子初出壳，名昆仑黄。次出外国，从蜀中来，色深而煌煌。”2．《海药本草》曰：“《广州记》云：生昆仑日脚下，颗块莹净，无夹石者良……蜀中雅州(今雅安等县)亦出，光腻甚好，功力不及舶上来者。”3．《本草图经》曰：“今惟出南海诸番，岭外(即岭南)州郡，或有而"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-isb3dki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-isb3dki","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-in27r98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-in27r98","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为自然元素类硫黄族矿物自然硫，主要用含硫物质或含硫矿物经炼制升华的结晶体。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-hq6ohs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-hq6ohs2","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Sulfur"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-c2dpmiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-c2dpmiu","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：采挖得自然硫后，加热熔化，除去杂质，或用含硫矿经加工制得。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-cr8eibj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-cr8eibj","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-pp9uc6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-pp9uc6m","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：自然硫主要形成于火山喷气作用，火山硫含少量砷、硒、锌和铊。沉积岩或风化带中的自然硫含粘土、有机质、沥青等机械混入物。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-a2ttw77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-a2ttw77","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：台湾省的自然硫及山西、新疆、山东、江苏、湖南、四川、贵州等地的有药用史，以上各省及甘肃、青海、内蒙古、陕西、河南、湖北、安徽、广西、广东、西藏等省区都有制品硫产销。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-3z0a3pz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-3z0a3pz","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-epa3k30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-epa3k30","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 自然硫 又名：斜方硫。晶体结构属斜方晶系。晶体为锥柱状、板柱、板状或针柱状，集合体呈致密或疏松块状，或为泉华状及隐晶的土状块体、皮壳、被膜等。黄、蜜黄或褐黄色；因合杂质可带灰、黑或绿、红色调。条痕白色至淡黄色。晶面金刚光泽，断口松脂或油脂状光泽。近透明至半透明。解理多组、不完全。致密块体呈贝壳状至不平坦状断口。硬度1-2。相对密度2.05-2.08。性脆、易碎；受热易产生裂纹。有硫黄臭味。热至270℃则燃着，火焰蓝色，并放出刺鼻臭气味。易溶于二硫化碳、松节油、煤油，但不溶于水及盐酸和硫酸；遇强硝酸和王水则被氧化为硫酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-wcqu68c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-wcqu68c","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-w9w9m40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-w9w9m40","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 硫黄呈不规则块状、粗颗粒状。浅黄色、黄色或略呈绿黄色。条痕白色或淡黄色。表面不平坦或粗糙，常具多数小孔隙。脂肪光泽。体轻，质松脆，易砸碎。有的断面呈蜂窝状，纵面可见细柱或针状晶体，近于平行排列，金刚光泽。具特异臭气，味淡。以块整齐、色黄、有光泽、质松脆、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-m8kdvt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-m8kdvt4","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 透射偏光镜下：无色透明，微带黄色。高突起，暗边明显。折光率 Np＝1．9579， Nm＝2．0371，Ng＝2．245。干涉色极高，斜消光。2V＝69°；双折射率＝0．2571。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ug1cpzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ug1cpzp","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版规定：本品含硫（S）不得少于98．5％。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-0q2to6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-0q2to6g","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"商品规格 商品一般分为硫黄、倭硫黄、天生黄三种。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-tw1ylpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-tw1ylpq","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）硫黄 为不规则块状，黄色或带浅绿色，不透明，表面较粗糙，常有细孔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-fc19pod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-fc19pod","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）倭硫黄 系将硫黄经过提炼而成。呈不规则块状，鲜黄色，半透明，表面较光滑，无细孔，系进口商品，质佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-5gqdf43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-5gqdf43","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）天生黄 呈大小不同的颗粒状，或砂状结晶，浅黄色，微有玻璃光泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-lr2ijzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-lr2ijzx","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-2sh9dbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-2sh9dbr","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主含硫(S)，尚杂有砷(As)、硒(Se)、碲(Te)等。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-deeamnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-deeamnu","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-lraq14o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-lraq14o","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.溶解角质、杀疥虫、杀菌、杀真菌的作用：局部外用，在体温状态下，硫与皮肤接触，产生硫化氢；或与微生物或上皮细胞作用，氧化成五硫黄酸(pentathionic acid)，从而有溶解角质、软化皮肤、杀灭疥虫等皮肤寄生虫及灭菌、杀真菌等作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-hyked41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-hyked41","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.缓泻作用：内服后一部分在肠内可形成硫化氢，刺激肠壁增加蠕动，而起缓泻作用。硫化氢在体内产生极慢，故致泻作用不强，且与用量大小无关。若肠内容物中脂肪性物质较多时，易产生大量的硫化氢。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-3z4n63j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-3z4n63j","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.消炎、镇咳、祛痰作用：适当剂量对动物实验性炎症有治疗作用，能使各级支气管慢性炎症细胞浸润减轻，并使支气管粘膜杯状细胞数有不同程度减少，还能促进支气管分泌增加。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-s0h7pn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-s0h7pn8","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.其他作用：对氯丙嗪及硫喷妥钠的中枢抑制作用，有明显增强作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-9bes68x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-9bes68x","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.毒性：未经炮制的天然硫黄含砷量较多，不宜内服，内服需用炮制过的硫黄，且不宜过量或久服，以免引起砷中毒。升华硫西黄耆胶混悬液给小鼠灌胃的半数致死量为0.266g/kg，中毒表现为拒食、肝肿大。服用过量硫黄，在肠内生成大量硫化氢及硫化物，被吸收入血液后，能使血红蛋白转变为硫化血红蛋白，引起组织缺氧，中枢神经对缺氧最敏感，可致中枢麻痹而死亡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-td00rhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-td00rhy","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-j1mls8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-j1mls8q","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1．1．硫黄《圣惠方》：“细研，水飞过。”1．2．《博济方》：“以柳木槌研三二日。”1．3．《孙尚药方》：“(用)牛角研令极细。”1．4．《普济方》：“去沙石，细研如飞尘。”“打碎。”现行，取原药材，除去杂质，捣成小块。生品有毒，多外用，以解毒杀虫，治癣为主。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-4iclv1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-4iclv1j","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2．1．豆腐制《医学纲目》：“入豆腐中煮三五沸。”《本经逢原》：“入豆腐中煮七次。”现行，先将豆腐切成片，铺一层于锅内，再铺上一层净硫黄块，如此层层铺好，加清水没过药材，用文火加热煮至豆腐显黑绿色时，取出，除去豆腐，漂净，阴干。每硫黄100kg，用豆腐200kg。制后降低毒性，以助阳益火为主。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-3fwj4oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-3fwj4oz","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．2．萝卜制：取净硫黄与萝卜共煮至萝卜烂时，取出，晒干。每硫黄100kg，用萝卜40kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-y01smx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-y01smx8","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．3．猪大肠制《医方集解》：“石硫黄一斤，猪大肠二尺，将硫黄为末，实猪大肠中，烂煮三时，取出去皮。”现行，取硫黄灌入猪肠内，煮后晾干，或将硫黄放入生猪肠内，两端扎紧，放热汤中煮3小时，反复3次，每次均另换猪肠。 据报道，硫黄的毒性成分主要为As2O3。按《中华人民共和国药典》“升华硫”项下砷盐检查方法测定As2O3含量，未经炮制过的为29.80×l0(-6)，超过《中华人民共和国药典》规定量的23.8倍。用溴-四氯化碳-硝酸湿法消解硫黄，二乙氨基二硫代甲酸银比色法，测定5种制硫黄中的砷含量。结果表明，炮制可降低硫黄中的捣As2O3含量，并以豆腐炮制品最为显着。说明豆腐制硫黄能降低其毒性。实验证明，硫黄和豆腐以l：1.5的比例进行炮制，制品含硫量可达到98%以上，含砷量低于或等于1μg/ml，符合《中华人民共和国药典》关于砷盐限量的规定。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-bw2rrwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-bw2rrwl","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饮片性状：硫黄参见\"药材鉴别\"项。制硫黄形如硫黄，黄褐色或黄绿色，臭气不明显。 贮干燥容器内，置干燥处，防火。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ccnv5z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ccnv5z3","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-lti7vwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-lti7vwt","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）本品燃烧时易熔融，火焰为蓝色，并有二氧化硫的刺激性臭气。（检查硫）（2）本品置于湿银面上摩擦，银面变黑色。（检查硫）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-bqa0byw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-bqa0byw","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-030axsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-030axsk","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肾；脾；肝；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-uysuovh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-uysuovh","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-09a5k7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-09a5k7v","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸；热；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-0pp4smx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-0pp4smx","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-w07l7rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-w07l7rg","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品有毒，内服宜用制品，不宜多服、久服。阴虚火旺患者及孕妇禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-csyupk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-csyupk1","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.徐之才《药对》：“畏细辛、飞廉、朴消、铁、醋。”(引自《纲目》)2.《本草衍义》：“中病当便已，不可尽剂。”3.《本经逢原》：“久服伤阴，大肠受伤，多致便血。”“热邪亢盛者禁用。”“湿热痿痹，良非所宜。”4.《得配本草》：“忌禽兽血。”“阴虚者禁用。”5.《本草用法研究》：“阴虚有火者勿用。”“外疮红肿者、有内热便闭者禁。”"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-mvp2bcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-mvp2bcx","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-rovhfye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-rovhfye","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补火壮阳；温脾通便；杀虫止痒。主阳痿；遗精；尿频；带下；寒喘；心腹冷痛；久泻久痢；便秘；疥疮；顽癣；秃疮；天疱疮；湿毒疮；阴蚀；阴疽；恶疮"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-j4zs36c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-j4zs36c","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-fizk86a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-fizk86a","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸、散，1.5-3g。外用：适量，研末撒；或油调敷；或烧烟熏。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-lhkynwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-lhkynwc","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-i36eioc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-i36eioc","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.硫黄软膏：沉降硫黄100g， 凡士林适量。取硫黄过80-100目筛后，缓缓加入已熔化的60℃的凡士林中，随加随搅拌，直至混匀，再加凡士林制成1000g，搅匀，即得。也可加适量液状石蜡，用加液研磨法配制；尚可配成5%、20%浓度。密闭，凉处贮存。本品为黄色软膏；有硫黄的特臭。本品用乙醚溶解除尽凡士林，挥尽乙醚，燃烧时火焰显蓝色，并发生二氧化硫刺激性臭。本品经处理后可用碘量法定量，含硫量应为标示量的90.0%-110.0%。功能溶解角质，抗真菌及抗寄生虫，并可制止皮脂溢出。用于治疗疥癣，体癣，花斑癣，皮脂溢出性皮炎等。外涂患处。(新疆《医院制剂》1981年；南京市卫生局《医院制剂规范》1989年)2.硫黄霜：硫黄100g，硬脂酸135g，凡士林(白)40g，氢氧化钾6.50g，甘油50g，尼泊金乙酯1g，蒸馏水适量。硬脂酸、凡士林、尼泊金乙酯置水浴上溶化，80℃保温；另取氢氧化钾溶于适量水中，使总量为1000g，加热至80℃，在不断搅拌下加入上述油液，待霜剂生成后，将硫黄(100目筛细粉)与甘油调成糊状后加入，继续搅至冷凝，即得。也可增减硫黄用量，配成5%和20%硫黄霜。用于疥癣。外涂患处。[《中国医院药学杂志》1984，(8)：39]"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-08o04mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-08o04mq","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-msfloz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-msfloz2","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《吴普本草》：“或生易阳，或河西，或五色。黄是潘水石液也，烧令有紫焰者。八月、九月采。”2.《别录》：“硫黄，生东海牧羊山谷中，及太山、河西山，矾石液也。”3.《本草经集注》：“此云矾石液，今南方则无矾石，恐不必尔。”4.《海药本草》：“仙方谓之黄硇砂，能坏五金，亦能造作金色，人能制服归本色。服而能除万病，如有发动，宜以猪肉鸭羹、余甘子汤并解之。蜀中雅州亦出，光腻甚好，功力不及舶上来者。”5.《丹房镜源》：“石硫黄，可干汞，诀曰：此硫黄见五金而黑，得水银而赤。又曰黄牙。”6.《纲目》：“凡产石硫黄之处，必有温泉，作硫黄气。《魏书》云：悦般有火山，山旁石皆焦熔，流地数十里乃凝坚，即石硫黄也。张华《博物志》云：西域硫黄出且弥山。去高昌八百里，有山高数十丈，昼则孔中状如烟，夜则如灯光。\"，又言坚筋骨者，取以治下部之寒湿。”(《本经逢原》)"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-ipwmp5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-ipwmp5y","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611112729-35gi3xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112729-35gi3xc","updated":"20240611112729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112731-kmyxdsi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112731-kmyxdsi"}},{"ID":"20240611112732-mpf4vjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112732-mpf4vjd"}}]}